msgid ""
"Used for adding methods to the `Base` prototype, and/or to the prototype "
"of child instances. When a mixin function returns a function, the "
"returned function is pushed onto the `.mixins` array, making it available"
" to be used on inheriting classes whenever `Base.mixins()` is called "
"(e.g. `Base.mixins(Child)`)."
